  "definition": {
    "en": "25 × 35 cm — a trade poster size, as sold by print shops and framers; sized to common frames rather than to ISO 216.",
    "nb": "25 × 35 cm — bransjeformat for plakater, slik trykkerier og rammemakere selger det; tilpasset vanlige rammer, ikke ISO 216.",
